    "text": "By ANDREW SIMPSON ,\n8 hours ago CHELAN — Closing part of US 97A on workdays could shorten construction of a waterline to Chelan Municipal Airport by about six weeks and save an estimated $300,000, city officials told the Chelan City Council on Oct. 13. The proposal would replace alternating, single-lane traffic on a portion of... Read full article",
